##DESCRIPTION=AlphaMissense=AlphaMissense pathogenicity score. Deleterious threshold > 0.564.
##DESCRIPTION=MaxEntScan=MaxEntScan reference score and alternate score for (1) native splice site, (2) acceptor gain and (3) donor gain. Comma-separated list if there are different predictions for several transcripts.
##DESCRIPTION=SpliceAI=SpliceAI prediction. These include delta scores (DS) and delta positions (DP) for acceptor gain (AG), acceptor loss (AL), donor gain (DG), and donor loss (DL). Format: GENE|DS_AG|DS_AL|DS_DG|DS_DL|DP_AG|DP_AL|DP_DG|DP_DL.
